esome Spider-Man characters introduced  in their universe and have them all come  together in a huge movie overall it  seems like Sony has kind of taken a play  from Marvel studios's book and trying to  somewhat replicate it with their own  twist which I think is a great  opportunity let's hope they pull it off  and let's hope that the silk series is  going to be a great series because again  she is a great character but let me know  what you think about all of this  information in the comments down below  let me know how excited you are for a  silk series don't forget to like the  video and subscribe to stay up to date  on all the latest news for live updates  you can follow me on Instagram and  Twitter and as always thank you all so  much for watching wolf wolf
 

